VERDICT: THE PLANE REMAINS USABLE BELOW THE BAND -- Q1, Q2 and Q3 all pass.
  The controller needs the coordinate and the sign from the table and measures its
  own gain by secant, so a 0.00x gain difference is inside what it already handles.

